\f0\b\fs48 \cf2 \expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec3 Project Context: ELEGOO Conqueror AI Wasp Nest Detection Robot\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa298\partightenfactor0

\fs36 \cf2 \strokec3 1. Project Overview\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs24 \cf2 \strokec3 We are a group of Computer Engineering students developing a mobile robotic system for an Intro to Robotics course.\

\f0\b \cf2 \strokec3 Project name:
\f1\b0 \cf2 \strokec3  Wasp Nest Destroyer 9000\

\f0\b \cf2 \strokec3 Primary objective:
\f1\b0 \cf2 \strokec3  Develop a remotely controlled tracked robot capable of streaming live camera footage to a host PC, identifying wasp nests using a pretrained computer vision model, and supporting automated camera alignment with detected targets.\
The initial project concept included a custom mounting assembly capable of holding an aerosol wasp-repellent canister. For software development and classroom testing, we will use inert hardware and simulated activation. The current development priority is the computer vision, networking, locomotion, and camera-alignment system.\
We want to demonstrate robotics concepts including:\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\ls1\ilvl0\cf2 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\cf2 \expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec3 Differential-drive locomotion using a tracked chassis.\
\ls1\ilvl0\cf2 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\cf2 \expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec3 Exteroception using an onboard camera and ultrasonic sensor.\
\ls1\ilvl0\cf2 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\cf2 \expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec3 Computer vision-based object detection.\
\ls1\ilvl0\cf2 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\cf2 \expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec3 Wireless communication between robot and host PC.\
\ls1\ilvl0\cf2 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\cf2 \expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec3 Closed-loop visual servoing for camera alignment.\
\ls1\ilvl0\cf2 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\cf2 \expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec3 Finite-state machine control and basic fault handling.\
\ls1\ilvl0\cf2 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\cf2 \expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec3 Manual remote control with optional autonomous capabilities.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\cf2 \strokec3 The project has a relatively small hardware budget, approximately $100\'96$150, so we are trying to use existing hardware and minimize additional purchases.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf2 \strokec4 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa298\partightenfactor0

