\fs24 \cf2 \strokec3 Arduino UNO R3-compatible controller
\f1\b0 \cf2 \strokec3 \
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\ls2\ilvl0\cf2 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\cf2 \expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec3 Handles motor control for the tracked drivetrain.\
\ls2\ilvl0\cf2 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\cf2 \expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec3 Controls the two-axis camera servo gimbal.\
\ls2\ilvl0\cf2 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\cf2 \expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec3 Interfaces with the ultrasonic distance sensor and other onboard sensors.\
\ls2\ilvl0\cf2 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\cf2 \expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec3 Receives commands through the ESP32 communication bridge.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f0\b \cf2 \strokec3 ESP32 camera/Wi-Fi controller
\f1\b0 \cf2 \strokec3 \
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\ls3\ilvl0\cf2 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\cf2 \expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec3 Provides the robot's wireless communications.\
\ls3\ilvl0\cf2 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\cf2 \expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec3 Captures video from the onboard camera.\
\ls3\ilvl0\cf2 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\cf2 \expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec3 Exposes the camera feed to a remote computer.\
\ls3\ilvl0\cf2 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\cf2 \expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec3 Relays movement and gimbal commands to the Arduino controller.\
\ls3\ilvl0\cf2 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\cf2 \expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec3 The referenced version uses an ESP32-WROVER, but some hardware revisions may use ESP32-S3. The actual hardware must be verified.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f0\b \cf2 \strokec3 Onboard camera
\f1\b0 \cf2 \strokec3 \
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\ls4\ilvl0\cf2 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\cf2 \expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec3 Camera included with the ELEGOO kit.\
\ls4\ilvl0\cf2 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\cf2 \expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec3 Intended to provide video frames for nest detection.\
\ls4\ilvl0\cf2 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\cf2 \expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec3 The exact frame resolution, achievable FPS, and stream format must be validated.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f0\b \cf2 \strokec3 Two-axis camera gimbal
\f1\b0 \cf2 \strokec3 \
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\ls5\ilvl0\cf2 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\cf2 \expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec3 Two small servos for pan and tilt.\
