\f1\b0\fs24 \cf2 \strokec6 Begin with hardware verification and a minimal working prototype.\
Do not immediately replace factory firmware or create an unnecessarily complex application.\
Use the simplest cross-platform architecture that can achieve reliable camera streaming and local object detection.\
Keep the camera, inference backend, robot communications, and user interface modular.\
The first success criterion is:\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f0\b \cf2 \strokec6 ELEGOO camera \uc0\u8594  Wi-Fi \u8594  Python/OpenCV on macOS or Windows \u8594  local Roboflow model \u8594  displayed detection boxes.
\f1\b0 \cf2 \strokec6 \
Only after this pipeline is functional should robot movement and camera alignment be integrated.\
